# This repo is scoped to just the public deliverable and the voter-
# registration sync automation -- everything else in this working
# directory (screenshots, scrape scripts, raw geojson/JSON dumps, etc.)
# stays local and untracked.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!index.html
!pa-districts-map.html
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!.github/
!.github/**

# ...except the script's own downloaded-file cache and Python cruft.
scripts/_currentvotestats.xlsx
scripts/__pycache__/
scripts/__pycache__/**
